    dcterms:identifier "GC-DURABLE-LEDGER"  ;
    rdfs:label "Durable run ledger (DETS/ETS) with replay, park, unwind"  ;
    dcterms:description "AshPPlan.Reactor.Durable.Engine replays a run's recorded steps through their implementations, parks on signals and polls, and unwinds on cancel over the AshPPlan.Reactor.Durable.Store behaviour. Two stores ship: Store.Ets (single-node, non-persistent reference) and Store.Dets (single local file, synced on every mutating call; a corrupted file fails closed at startup). Effects are at-least-once across a crash; Durable.Key idempotency keys are the mitigation. Counterfactual replay and in-flight run migration exist as AshPPlan.Reactor.Durable.Counterfactual and AshPPlan.Reactor.Durable.Migration."  ;
